---
import AccessLayout from '../../layouts/AccessLayout.astro';const token=Astro.url.searchParams.get('token')||'';
---
<AccessLayout title="Confirmar correo"><h1>Confirma tu nuevo correo.</h1><p>Al confirmar, usarás el nuevo correo para ingresar y se cerrarán tus sesiones anteriores.</p><form data-auth-form="confirm-email" class="account-form"><input type="hidden" name="token" value={token}/><div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit">Confirmar cambio →</button><a class="button outline" href="/admin/login">Cancelar</a></div><p data-auth-status class="form-status" role="status"></p></form></AccessLayout>
